	</row>
	<row id="msg_0635_T30R0601_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0635_T30R0601_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0635_T30R0601_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Les capacités ultimes seront enseignées\naux Pokémon de cette liste!\rLes Pokémon aux flammes rougeoyantes\nDRACAUFEU TYPHLOSION\fBRASEGALI SIMIABRAZ\rLes Pokémon des eaux déchaînées\nTORTANK ALIGATUEUR\fLAGGRON PINGOLEON\rLes Pokémon de l’herbe bruissante\nFLORIZARRE MEGANIUM\fJUNGKO TORTERRA</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0635_T30R0601_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bien, nous allons enseigner une\ncapacité à ton {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}...\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
